Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 12:38:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Force Now Nudge Galaxy AI availability

Force SecSettings to treat Now Nudge as available in the Galaxy AI list
while preserving the original method registers and fallback code.

---
 .../intelligenceservice/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController.smali     | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/usefulfeature/intelligence/intelligenceservice/controller/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/usefulfeature/intelligence/intelligenceservice/controller/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController.smali
--- a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/usefulfeature/intelligence/intelligenceservice/controller/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/usefulfeature/intelligence/intelligenceservice/controller/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController.smali
@@ -144,4 +144,8 @@
 .method private supportsNowNudges()Z
     .locals 1
+
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
+
+    return v0

     invoke-direct {p0}, Lcom/samsung/android/settings/usefulfeature/intelligence/intelligenceservice/controller/NowNudgesGalaxyAIController;->checkAiVersion()Z
